- **Step 7 (log):** I created `logs/2026-10-26.md` with the URLs checked, what was skipped and why, and the judgement calls.
- **Step 8 (check the file):** node loads the file with 2,416 records. IDs and date/place/fish combinations are all unique, every record has a source link, and line endings are unchanged (CRLF).
- **Step 9 (stop):** done. I didn't touch the combined HTML or anything else; `run-collect.ps1` rebuilds the HTML next.

